      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}5\\text{ parts}&=150\\text{ jellybeans}\\\\1\\text{ part}&=150\\div5=30\\text{ jellybeans}\\\\\\text{Red initially}&=2\\times30=60\\text{ jellybeans}\\\\\\text{Blue initially}&=3\\times30=90\\text{ jellybeans}\\\\\\text{Red remaining}&=60-10=50\\text{ jellybeans}\\\\\\text{Blue remaining}&=90-10=80\\text{ jellybeans}\\\\\\text{Red}:\\text{blue}&=50:80=5:8\\end{align*}$$",
